id: distant-energy-gatherer
name: Distant Energy Gatherer
advancement: true
prerequisite: 4+ Skill Ranks in Clairvoyance
tpCost: 10
# Whether there are nearby worlds to draw from is the ARC's.
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Lifeforce drawn from other nearby worlds, if the ARC says there are any.
text: >
  Distant Energy Gatherer: Reaching out through the void, you call upon the energy of other planets.
  –Prerequisites: 4+ Skill Ranks in Clairvoyance
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: You may draw the Lifeforce from other nearby worlds. When using Energy Gathering, you may ask your ARC if there
  are nearby planets to draw from, rather than the planet you are currently on. If so, then you may draw the Lifeforce
  from those worlds.
